{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_102_maira_1-title\">MAIRA-1</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">MAIRA-1 不是通用图文预训练模型，而是冻结胸片 RAD-DINO、使用四层 adapter，并完整微调 Vicuna-7B 的专用报告生成器。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Specialist chest X-ray report generator pairing a frozen CXR-specific RAD-DINO visual encoder, a 4-layer MLP adapter, and a fully fine-tuned Vicuna-7B LLM.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">胸部 X 光图像及可选 indication 文本</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Frontal chest X-ray + clinical indication/history prompt</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">放射报告 Findings 文本</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Structured clinical radiology Findings narrative</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Table 3 · PDF p.6</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构表</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.13668\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_102_maira_1')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_102_maira_1')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"MAIRA-1 original paper architecture figure, Table 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/708bcf405db93275ddb5.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Table 3 · PDF p.6</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_102_maira_1', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_102_maira_1\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_102_maira_1')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_102_maira_1', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_102_maira_1\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">胸片输入</span><span class=\"lang-en\">chest X-ray (CXR) input</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">高分辨率正位胸片；训练域为 MIMIC-CXR</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests frontal chest x-ray + clinical indication/history prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (chest X-ray (CXR) input).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"高分辨率正位胸片；训练域为 MIMIC-CXR\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests frontal chest x-ray + clinical indication/history prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (chest X-ray (CXR) input).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"胸片输入\" data-node-name-en=\"chest X-ray (CXR) input\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_102_maira_1', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">胸片输入</span><span class=\"lang-en\">chest X-ray (CXR) input</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">高分辨率正位胸片；训练域为 MIMIC-CXR</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests frontal chest x-ray + clinical indication/history prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (chest X-ray (CXR) input).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可提供检查问题和生成格式\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Indication/ prompt to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Indication/提示文本\" data-node-name-en=\"Indication/ prompt\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_102_maira_1', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Indication/提示文本</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Indication/ prompt</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可提供检查问题和生成格式</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Indication/ prompt to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"518 像素胸片专用视觉 encoder，输出较密集图像 token\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs RAD-DINO ViT-B within the core specialist cxr adapter report llm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"冻结 RAD-DINO ViT-B\" data-node-name-en=\"RAD-DINO ViT-B\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_102_maira_1', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">冻结 RAD-DINO ViT-B</span><span class=\"lang-en\">RAD-DINO ViT-B</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">518 像素胸片专用视觉 encoder，输出较密集图像 token</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs RAD-DINO ViT-B within the core specialist cxr adapter report llm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把 RAD-DINO token 映射到 Vicuna embedding 空间\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs adapter within the core specialist cxr adapter report llm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"四层前馈 adapter\" data-node-name-en=\"adapter\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_102_maira_1', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">四层前馈 adapter</span><span class=\"lang-en\">adapter</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把 RAD-DINO token 映射到 Vicuna embedding 空间</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs adapter within the core specialist cxr adapter report llm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对报告生成任务进行完整 fine-tuning，而非只训练 adapter\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Vicuna-7B within the core specialist cxr adapter report llm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Vicuna-7B\" data-node-name-en=\"Vicuna-7B\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_102_maira_1', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Vicuna-7B</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对报告生成任务进行完整 fine-tuning，而非只训练 adapter</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Vicuna-7B within the core specialist cxr adapter report llm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对训练报告进行改写，增加叙述多样性\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs GPT-3.5 within the core specialist cxr adapter report llm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"GPT-3.5 文本增强\" data-node-name-en=\"GPT-3.5\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_102_maira_1', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">GPT-3.5 文本增强</span><span class=\"lang-en\">GPT-3.5</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对训练报告进行改写，增加叙述多样性</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs GPT-3.5 within the core specialist cxr adapter report llm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"视觉与文本条件下教师强制训练\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies next-token loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"报告 next-token loss\" data-node-name-en=\"next-token loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_102_maira_1', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">报告 next-token loss</span><span class=\"lang-en\">next-token loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">视觉与文本条件下教师强制训练</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies next-token loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"自动生成胸片所见段落\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces structured clinical radiology findings narrative via Findings.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Findings 草稿\" data-node-name-en=\"Findings\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_102_maira_1', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Findings 草稿</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Findings</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">自动生成胸片所见段落</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces structured clinical radiology findings narrative via Findings.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"MAIRA-1 Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · RAD-DINO 经四层适配器条件化报告生成</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Frozen RAD-DINO Patch Tokens Projected via 4-Layer Adapter into Fine-Tuned LLM</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"MAIRA-1：核心公式 · RAD-DINO 经四层适配器条件化报告生成\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"102\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"21.339504pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.723074 -69.011212 304.274103 21.339504\" width=\"304.274103pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M2.85475 0V-.108683C2.282351-.115929 2.166422-.188385 2.166422-.536171V-4.883507L2.108458-4.897998L.804257-4.238652V-4.137214C.891204-4.173442 .970905-4.202424 .999887-4.216916C1.130307-4.267635 1.253482-4.296617 1.325937-4.296617C1.478094-4.296617 1.543304-4.187933 1.543304-3.956075V-.673837C1.543304-.434734 1.48534-.268086 1.369411-.202876C1.260727-.137666 1.15929-.115929 .854976-.108683V0H2.85475Z\" id=\"m102_g20-49\"></path><path d=\"M3.4